    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Philippe Duclos",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117356265326230764303/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJt2AqwmoqieCnDErM2cMoZKl2QtaASLEkcsVvfepc3SHa9gw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Absolutely blown away by the service! These movers were fast, professional, and incredibly efficient. They handled a full move from a third-floor apartment and got it done in record time seriously impressive. Not only did they move quickly, but they also took great care with our furniture and fragile items. Courteous, strong, and clearly experienced. I’d highly recommend them to anyone looking for a stress-free and smooth move. Worth every penny!",
        "time": 1750382071,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Shauna Golemic",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101884306137191563057/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK2cYkYAZHVk8HGPv63ASB1L1qqDdTcPxf9WRLRd0IjLDro4A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "We had a fantastic experience with GP move! They were on time, were very efficient and treated all of our belongings with great care. The team was very professional and took the time to meticulously wrap all of our furniture to ensure nothing got damaged during the move. We would 100% recommend GP move.",
        "time": 1762562961,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Michael Caponi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116680799047546283026/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIIAZLoBN-w1v3dEj2dsppCffWGlovX4VP-IQHpgIy7NJ6ggw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Impeccable service - don't look anywhere else. They didn't even bat an eye when I called them asking to make arrangements for my move the very NEXT day. The movers arrived at my office 15 minutes before they were supposed to come - and handled everything with so much care - and efficiency. The service provided by G&P made the transition 100x easier.\n\nHighly recommended!",
        "time": 1764345081,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "miranda m",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103481338274101944027/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJrhp7MHczWc5HnLFlAdWkzIgLlp8zghW4zg09iaWXN0XwW7JY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Absolutely amazing movers! They arrived on time, were friendly, were careful with our belongings, and were efficient! This has truly been our best experience with a moving company and we would happily pick them again for our next move! Highly recommend this team!",
        "time": 1760719740,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Erin Glaysher",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118302607318150922421/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocILPOPabrH9CGk_yVYzpimXprciGNXmAJunrxR-mndjsGNJXQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Extremely efficient, professional and punctual. Would highly recommend to anyone moving in the Montreal area and beyond. They managed a 4th floor walk up to a 2nd floor walk up move, in the rain, through crazy constriction zones. The guys are so friendly and the pricing is very reasonable and transparent. Thank you G&P!!",
        "time": 1756398048,
